      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Consumers",
      "items": [
        "The CMS UI edits drafts and publishes with JWT",
        "Each user's frontend reads /public/** with no authentication",
        "/admin/** is reserved and does not exist yet"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Hexagonal core",
      "items": [
        "Controllers and JWT live in adapters/in",
        "Use cases validate ownership; authentication is not enough",
        "JSONB content is opaque to the backend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Publication",
      "items": [
        "No status column: published = a *_published row exists",
        "GET /public returns 404 when that row is absent",
        "One PostgreSQL database: identity, ltree, and JSONB together"
